    'navigation_workspace_s3' => 'Owners and staff see Products & Stock pages such as Place codes, Product list, Stock, Branches, and Branch performance.',
    'navigation_workspace_s4' => 'Dealers see Network and Ranks. Sub-dealers see Salary instead of the network tree.',
    'navigation_workspace_s5' => 'Switch language with EN / বাংলা. Labels, the manual, and many notices follow the language you choose.',
    'navigation_workspace_s6' => 'Use the Day / Night button for a light or dark screen. Your choice is saved in this browser for all Madina panels.',
    'navigation_workspace_s7' => 'Owners and staff can use the branch selector (when branches exist) to see stock and deliveries for one branch.',
    'navigation_workspace_s8' => 'Open notices and circulars from the Account section when the company posts daily notices.',
    'navigation_workspace_summary' => 'Use the sidebar groups, search Help, and change language or theme without losing your place.',
    'navigation_workspace_t1' => 'If a section is missing, you probably do not have permission for it. The link is not broken.',
    'navigation_workspace_t2' => 'On mobile the sidebar is hidden. Tap the menu button to open it.',
    'navigation_workspace_title' => 'Menu, sections, language, and theme',
    'navigation_workspace_w1' => 'Clearing browser data resets your theme and language. Day mode comes back as the default.',
    'navigation_workspace_why' => 'Madina puts many pages into groups that open and close. Knowing this map means fewer “feature missing” support requests.',
    'network_genealogy_badge' => 'Network & team',
